{
  "info": {
    "name": "COMP229 Assignment 2 - MyPortfolio API",
    "description": "Run the folders top to bottom. 'Users & Auth' step 4 signs in and saves the token automatically; ids are saved automatically too. Import into Postman (File > Import) or Thunder Client (Collections > Import).",
